{
    "title": "INKR \u2014 Comics, Manga, Webtoons",
    "description": "THE NO.1 DESTINATION FOR COMICS, MANGA, WEB TOONS, MANHUA AND MORE \r\n\r\nOVER 1,000 DIVERSE TITLES\r\nExplore hit and niche titles from publishers large and small, alongside independent studio gems and creator-owned comics. Action, romance, comedy, horror, drama, isekai, slice of life, sci-fi, and more, all in one app.\r\n\r\nSEAMLESS EXPLORATION\r\nIt\u2019s easier than ever to know whether a title is your cup of tea: when browsing between titles, you can seamlessly preview the first several pages of a chapter to check out the artwork and story, without having to download content or even open the viewer. \r\n\r\nPERSONALIZED RECOMMENDATIONS\r\nNo need to manually search for new titles to read \u2014 we\u2019ll find you stories that you love. Our smart, powerful AI-powered content recommendation engine learns from your reading to suggest titles just for you.\r\n\r\nIMMERSIVE VIEWER\r\nImmerse yourself in comics with a viewer that adapts to every type of comic for fuss-free and seamless reading, on any device.\r\n\r\nEASY ORGANIZATION\r\nThe day of just managing your reading list with just a \u201cFavorites\u201d tab is over! Now, you can add titles to various lists including: Recently Read, Read Later, Subscribed, Liked, Disliked. \r\n\r\nUPDATES & NOTIFICATIONS\r\nNever miss a chapter of your favorite comics. The app keeps track of all your updates, and you\u2019ll get notifications when new chapters are released.\r\n\r\nAUTO-SYNC\r\nHave more than one device? As long as you use the same INKR account, your data and reading progress will automatically sync \u2014 across all platforms.\r\n\r\n\r\nDIRECTLY SUPPORT CREATORS\r\nRevenues from INKR Comics are split with content creators and publishers, empowering them to bring you more amazing content.\r\n\r\nWelcome to INKR Comics: the first truly international comic platform, made by comic lovers.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Some contents will not be available in certain regions due to licensing restrictions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "THE NO.1 DESTINATION FOR COMICS, MANGA, WEB TOONS, MANHUA AND MORE <br><br>OVER 1,000 DIVERSE TITLES<br>Explore hit and niche titles from publishers large and small, alongside independent studio gems and creator-owned comics. Action, romance, comedy, horror, drama, isekai, slice of life, sci-fi, and more, all in one app.<br><br>SEAMLESS EXPLORATION<br>It\u2019s easier than ever to know whether a title is your cup of tea: when browsing between titles, you can seamlessly preview the first several pages of a chapter to check out the artwork and story, without having to download content or even open the viewer. <br><br>PERSONALIZED RECOMMENDATIONS<br>No need to manually search for new titles to read \u2014 we\u2019ll find you stories that you love. Our smart, powerful AI-powered content recommendation engine learns from your reading to suggest titles just for you.<br><br>IMMERSIVE VIEWER<br>Immerse yourself in comics with a viewer that adapts to every type of comic for fuss-free and seamless reading, on any device.<br><br>EASY ORGANIZATION<br>The day of just managing your reading list with just a \u201cFavorites\u201d tab is over! Now, you can add titles to various lists including: Recently Read, Read Later, Subscribed, Liked, Disliked. <br><br>UPDATES &amp; NOTIFICATIONS<br>Never miss a chapter of your favorite comics. The app keeps track of all your updates, and you\u2019ll get notifications when new chapters are released.<br><br>AUTO-SYNC<br>Have more than one device? As long as you use the same INKR account, your data and reading progress will automatically sync \u2014 across all platforms.<br><br><br>DIRECTLY SUPPORT CREATORS<br>Revenues from INKR Comics are split with content creators and publishers, empowering them to bring you more amazing content.<br><br>Welcome to INKR Comics: the first truly international comic platform, made by comic lovers.<br><br>Disclaimer: Some contents will not be available in certain regions due to licensing res